{
  "id": "conditioned-stimulus",
  "term": "conditioned stimulus",
  "definition": "A conditioned stimulus is a previously neutral person, object, or situation that becomes linked through learning with an emotional or behavioral response after being paired with an unconditioned stimulus. After this association forms, the conditioned stimulus can later trigger the conditioned response on its own.",
